  "description": "9/30/2024",
  "body_html": "<p>This post reflects my current views on the market, sectors, and internal breadth/momentum. Expect candid, data-driven analysis, peppered with personal insights drawn from years of trading experience. I aim to provide value in every edition, helping you to see the market through a clearer, more informed lens.</p><p><strong>What You Can Expect</strong></p><ul><li><p><strong>In-Depth Market Analysis</strong>: A thorough examination of market trends, key indices, and pivotal turning points.</p></li><li><p><strong>Sector Spotlights</strong>: A closer look at the hottest (and not-so-hot) sectors, highlighting opportunities and risks.</p></li><li><p><strong>Breadth and Momentum Insights</strong>: Understanding the underlying strength of the market through breadth indicators and momentum metrics.</p></li></ul><p><strong>Exclusive Features</strong></p><ul><li><p><strong>Interactive Spreadsheet</strong>: Alongside each post, I’ll be linking a detailed spreadsheet that tracks the breadth and momentum metrics. This will allow you to follow along with the data and see the trends I’m analyzing in real-time.</p></li><li><p><strong>Quick Video Commentary</strong>: To complement the metrics, I’ll also be posting a quick video commentary on most days. This will provide a more dynamic overview of the market, offering you additional context and clarity.</p></li></ul><h1>Market Metrics</h1><h4>Overall: Positive</h4><p>So far the indices are holding their trends above the 10/20 MA and breadth/momentum have shifted back to positive (albeit slightly) after being under pressure for 4-5 days. Continued expansion of NHs and up momentum and contraction of NLs and down momentum would be a good sign and add support to a bounce off the MAs from here.</p><h4>Index Trends: Up</h4><ul><li><p>Large Cap: Up</p></li><li><p>Mid Cap: Up</p></li><li><p>Small Cap: Up</p></li></ul><h4>Overall NH/NL Breadth: Positive</h4><ul><li><p>Large Cap: Positive</p></li><li><p>Mid Cap: Positive</p></li><li><p>Small Cap: Positive</p></li></ul><h4>Overall Up/Down Momentum: Positive</h4><ul><li><p>Large Cap: Positive</p></li><li><p>Mid Cap: Positive</p></li><li><p>Small Cap: Positive</p></li></ul><h1>Market Recap</h1><p><a href=\"https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/17ZVDw8_Ujk3bSUx-XRUU5jHaNb5F5j3NX6enuNBYudI/edit?gid=129941580#gid=129941580\">Market Monitor (Click Here)</a></p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Avhs!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F550f7c73-1adc-4e41-b1fa-8b712fc0ff8f_1694x678.png\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Avhs!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F550f7c73-1adc-4e41-b1fa-8b712fc0ff8f_1694x678.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Avhs!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F550f7c73-1adc-4e41-b1fa-8b712fc0ff8f_1694x678.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Avhs!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F550f7c73-1adc-4e41-b1fa-8b712fc0ff8f_1694x678.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Avhs!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F550f7c73-1adc-4e41-b1fa-8b712fc0ff8f_1694x678.png 1456w\" sizes=\"auto, 100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Avhs!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F550f7c73-1adc-4e41-b1fa-8b712fc0ff8f_1694x678.png\" widt